    <h2>Install it on the office computer</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:12px">
      The software runs in a browser and works the same either way. The desktop
      version is for the front desk: it opens on its own and remembers the address
      of your school's software, so nobody has to type it.
    </p>

    <div id="download-box" class="card" style="margin-top:26px;max-width:56ch">
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" id="download-btn" href="#contact" aria-disabled="true">
        Windows installer: being prepared
      </a>
      <p class="small muted" id="download-meta" style="margin-top:12px"></p>
      <p class="small muted" id="download-notes" hidden style="margin-top:6px"></p>
      <details hidden style="margin-top:14px">
